{"type":"text","timestamp":1792263576498,"sessionID":"ses_eb4c69a00ffecdiCvGl5LzE5aU","part":{"id":"prt_14b3bc18a002ymuPHmXaZFCu4U","sessionID":"ses_eb4c69a00ffecdiCvGl5LzE5aU","messageID":"msg_14b3bb70b001tdTiThJzlxAbMH","type":"text","text":"# Independent exact-SHA semantic review — TTQS ONE 0058 R06\n\n## Overall verdict\n**PASS — qualified semantic review only.**  \nThis is a mature, usable SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC candidate for I13-E02 / checkbox 062. It is **not** formal/REAL TTQS acceptance and must not be represented as association execution, approval, or certified performance.\n\n## Exact candidate binding\n- DOCX SHA-256 independently calculated: `B7F8806A204EB6CB9C1F9FA2F84B016B6F1EAFB56FF43E5C7C02E2499CE13B07`\n- Requested DOCX SHA-256: `B7F8806A204EB6CB9C1F9FA2F84B016B6F1EAFB56FF43E5C7C02E2499CE13B07`\n- **SHA match: YES.**\n- Render PDF SHA-256 independently calculated: `86F427DB160BF716CAFFF63201672EC3BD91921F6BD77736B5E8C6F3A31877FF`\n- Requested render PDF SHA-256: `86F427DB160BF716CAFFF63201672EC3BD91921F6BD77736B5E8C6F3A31877FF`\n- **Render PDF match: YES.**\n- Manifest binding checked: `inputs/manifest.json` lists the same DOCX/PDF hashes and byte sizes.\n- **Candidate mutation status: NO MUTATION.** Review was read-only; only temporary extraction/search scripts were written outside the packet. The candidate DOCX/PDF bytes were not modified.\n\n## 1. Identity, official mapping, and genre\n- Confirmed identity: `doc_id = 0058`, `requirement_id = I13-E02`, `checkbox_serial = 062`, official locator page 4, Indicator 13, second checkbox, continuation page 5.\n- Official requirement is reproduced in the document front matter and Table 10-1, and the content is the micro-level “learning transfer to work” tool required by I13-E02.\n- Genre is correct: **training-after-work application, individual SMART action plan, assistance, team incentive proposal, and personal/group/organization effectiveness record/tool**.\n- Distinguished from neighbors:\n  - **0057 / I13-E01 / checkbox 061**: macro-level transfer review/achievement review meeting and institutional improvement. 0058 does not substitute for that; it focuses on learner-level tracking, four-column records, assistance, incentive proposal, and quantitative three-level improvement.\n  - **0059 / I13-E03 / checkbox 063**: retraining, reflection, certification, internship mechanisms. 0058 is not a retraining notice, internship assessment, or reflection report and does not use certificates/internship records as action plans.\n- Negative-neighbor rejection is explicit in Sections 1 and 10 and Table 10-2.\n\n## 2. Maturity and usability as an association-facing tool\nThe candidate is a mature, usable proposal/tool, not a generic skeleton. It contains:\n- Six-step SOP proposal with timing, roles, outputs, and exception handling (Section 2; Table 2-1).\n- Four-step behavior rubric 0–4 (reception, listening, recording, boundary/referral) (Section 3; Table 3-1).\n- Pre/post simulation results for six learners (Table 3-2).\n- Six individual SMART plans with targets, assistance, obstacles, adjustments, and per-learner verdicts (Section 4; Table 4-1).\n- Strict four-column record standard and one complete demonstrated record (Section 5; Tables 5-1, 5-2).\n- Team incentive formula, threshold, ethics veto, non-monetary reward, and two-group calculation (Section 6; Tables 6-1, 6-2).\n- Blank operational forms for future use (Section 7; Tables 7-1, 7-2).\n- Real-data replacement register and audit matrix (Sections 8–9; Tables 8-1, 9-1).\n- Official source mapping, adjacent-indicator distinction, and version control (Section 10; Tables 10-1 to 10-3).\n\n## 3. Completeness of forms, rubric, sample case, ownership, timing, evidence, and HOLD/REJECT criteria\n- **Rubric:** Table 3-1 defines 0–4 levels with concrete behaviors and guidance for each level.\n- **Sample case:** `case_id = SYN-0058-202608`; fictional course “志工服務接待、需求傾聽與資源轉介界線”; baseline 2026-07-16 to 2026-08-14; course 2026-08-15; tracking 2026-08-16 to 2026-09-14; 19 expected service opportunities.\n- **Ownership/timing:** Roles are consistently “建議由章程授權者指定”; dates and tracking windows are explicitly labeled as demonstration settings.\n- **Evidence instructions:** Section 8 lists REQ-0058-01 to REQ-0058-08 with source form, responsible role, minimum evidence standard, and rejection/correction conditions.\n- **HOLD/REJECT criteria:** Table 9-1 contains 10 concrete scenarios with REJECT/HOLD levels, suggested handling, and prevention measures.\n- Blank forms in Section 7 are explicitly separated from demonstration data and marked “實際使用時另開新表填寫,” which is the permitted exception for operational blank forms.\n\n## 4. Arithmetic, case_id, and 41 synthetic facts\nAll material calculations were recomputed and agree with the document:\n\n- Pre-test: scores `A=2, B=2, C=1, D=2, E=3, F=2`; total `12`; average `2.00`; pass rate `1/6 = 16.7%`.\n- Post-test: scores `A=4, B=3, C=3, D=4, E=3, F=2`; total `19`; average `3.1667` (reported `3.17`); pass rate `5/6 = 83.3%`.\n- Pass-rate improvement: exact `(5/6 - 1/6) × 100 = 66.6667%`, reported as `+66.7 pp`; the document correctly notes the endpoint difference `83.3 - 16.7 = 66.6` is a rounding display artifact.\n- Individual SMART results: A `2/2 = 100%` pass; B `3/4 = 75%` pass; C `2/3 = 66.7%` fail; D `4/4 = 100%` pass; E `3/4 = 75%` pass; F `0/2` with no evidence, retained in denominator as “未能確認／不列達標.”\n- Main effectiveness: `4/6 = 66.7%`, below the `>=75%` proposal target. Supplementary evidence-submitter rate `4/5 = 80.0%` is correctly labeled non-substituting.\n- Evidence submission rate: `5/6 = 83.3%`, meeting the `>=80%` proposal threshold.\n- Four-column completeness:\n  - Group A baseline `4/9 = 44.4%`; tracking `7/9 = 77.8%`; exact improvement `+33.3333 pp` reported as `+33.3 pp`.\n  - Group B baseline `5/10 = 50.0%`; tracking `7/10 = 70.0%`; improvement `+20.0 pp`.\n  - Organization baseline `9/19 = 47.4%`; tracking `14/19 = 73.7%`; exact improvement `26.3158%` reported as `+26.3 pp`.\n- Incentive calculations:\n  - Group A: `60% × (7/9) + 40% × (3/3) = 46.67 + 40.00 = 86.67` (reported `86.7`), pass threshold.\n  - Group B: `60% × (7/10) + 40% × (2/3) = 42.00 + 26.67 = 68.67` (reported `68.7`), below threshold.\n- `case_id = SYN-0058-202608` is consistent in metadata, blueprint, JSON, CSV, and DOCX.\n- Synthetic facts: **41 in JSON**, **41 in CSV**, all IDs unique and identical between JSON and CSV; all use the `SYN-0058-202608-F##` pattern.\n\n## 5. SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC versus REAL boundary\n- The boundary is clearly and repeatedly stated: official requirement text and source locator are formal-source references; all case data, learners, scores, service records, dates, percentages, incentive proposal, and verdicts are SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC under `SYN-0058-202608`.\n- The document does not claim the association has already executed, approved, certified, or implemented the proposal.\n- Unsupported or unverified facts are handled correctly:\n  - Roles are “建議由章程授權者指定,” not asserted as existing permanent posts.\n  - Incentive scheme is explicitly “提案、未核定、未設立、未生效、未實際執行、未發放.”\n  - Medical boundary is framed as “本示範情境中的服務單位不提供醫療診斷或療效保證,” not as a verified organizational fact.\n  - Public-resource referral is generic and explicitly requires verification against current official sources; no fabricated agency names/phone numbers/third-party letters.\n  - Table 8-1 uses `REQ-0058-01` to `REQ-0058-08` and marks status UNKNOWN.\n  - Section 9 is a proposal matrix, not an asserted existing review authority.\n- No third-party originals, signatures, certificates, government letters, bank/accounting evidence, or external achievements are fabricated.\n\n## 6. R05 finding repair verification\n- Prohibited literal placeholder scan across all DOCX XML found **0 occurrences** of `待填`, `待核`, `保持空白`, and `會後填寫`. `空白表` occurs **4 times**, all in explicitly labeled blank operational-table contexts:\n  - front-matter quick-read table note referencing the Table 7-1 / Table 7-2 blank operational tables;\n  - Section 7 paragraph introducing the blank operational forms;\n  - Table 7-1 caption: `志工個人 SMART 行動計畫與輔導追蹤空白表（實際使用時另開新表）`;\n  - Table 7-2 caption: `志工服務關懷四欄紀錄現場查核空白表（實際使用時另開新表）`.\n  These are permitted operational blank forms, not placeholder body content.\n- Table 1-1 identifies revision **R06**: row `文件流水號 | 0058（版次 R06）` (Table 1-1, second table in document).\n- Table 10-3 records R06 accurately: final row `R06 | 2026-10-18 | 正文用語及版次標籤校正 | ... | PRE_BUILD_SYNTHETIC_DRAFT / 待建置與審查` (last table in document).\n\n## 7. Page-flow correction and readability assessment\n- DOCX XML contains `w:pageBreakBefore` immediately before the Table 3-1 caption paragraph, and the table follows immediately after that caption.\n- PDF text extraction confirms the Table 3-1 caption appears on **page 7** of the 32-page render.\n- Table 7-2 caption appears on page 23; its caption/table are not split across the page bottom.\n- Text extraction shows no empty pages and no page with only a caption/table fragment; all 32 pages carry substantive text.\n- **Visual limitation:** The available review tools cannot render or view the attached JPG contact sheets or PDF pages as images. Therefore I cannot independently confirm graphical layout details such as exact visual clipping, table overflow, orphan headings, or margin aesthetics. This limitation is separate from the semantic findings above. No material text-level readability defect was identified from DOCX XML/PDF text extraction.\n\n## Findings\n- **No blocking semantic findings.**\n- Residual non-blocking limitation: graphical/page-image layout was not visually inspected due to tool limitations.\n- The candidate remains a SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC draft and must not be treated as REAL evidence, approved policy, or formal TTQS acceptance.\n\n## Recommendation\n- **Accept as a semantically verified SAMPLE candidate** (`PASS`, qualified).\n- Eligible for Codex serialized promotion to CURRENT under the HOTFIX5 pipeline if the project’s static/layout gates also pass.\n- Before any formal TTQS submission, replace SAMPLE data with genuine, traceable, authorized REAL evidence and obtain Human acceptance; keep all SAMPLE/UNKNOWN markings until that replacement is verified.","time":{"start":1792263569802,"end":1792263576498}}}
